is worth 4 points as both Seat and Prevalent Wind if I can make it a pung), keeps my other pairs (W8, T1) intact for potential melds, and doesn't discard any terminals that might be useful for terminal-based patterns. This is the safest and most strategic discard.\n\nAnswer: Play J2"}
